{
  "id": "workout-stop-status-regression",
  "split": "regression",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "training-final-v2",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "我想核实当前进度，先不要结束训练。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "status": "active",
            "logs": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "好了今天停这儿，只有记过的那些算练了，其他保持没记，帮我存档结束。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "status": "active",
            "logs": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "同意，照刚才的实际记录保存，不补任何组。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "status": "finished",
            "sets": [
              3
            ],
            "logs": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "深蹲的最后一组实际是57.5公斤，并不是60；次数和组数照旧。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "weights": [
              60
            ],
            "audits": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "先撤掉这次改动，原来的先留着。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "cancelled",
              "rejected"
            ],
            "weights": [
              60
            ],
            "audits": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "重新确认过了，深蹲实际只有前两组，第三组误记，请更正实际总组数。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "sets": [
              3
            ],
            "audits": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "对，只确认这项组数修订。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "sets": [
              2
            ],
            "weights": [
              55
            ],
            "logs": 1,
            "audits": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "核对一下最终日志，然后重复结束也别重复写入。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "status": "finished",
            "sets": [
              2
            ],
            "weights": [
              55
            ],
            "logs": 1,
            "audits": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}